---
/**
 * The Stelstone landing — native implementation of the design comp
 * "Stelstone Landing A" (claude.ai/design, project b4f16a71). The .dc
 * runtime's bindings are translated to plain HTML/CSS/JS:
 *   hidden="{{ isTR }}"  →  .l-en / .l-tr spans toggled by html[data-lang]
 *   style-hover          →  real :hover rules
 *   copy / lang buttons  →  the inline script at the bottom
 *
 * Two factual corrections against the comp (code truth beats mockups):
 * the npm package is `stelstone` (not @natilon/astro-cms), and the deploy
 * button targets natilon/stelstone-starter (the monorepo isn't deployable).
 */
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Stelstone — the git-based CMS your editors can't break</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Stelstone is the git-based CMS where editors can't break the site: every record is a file in your repo, every publish is a commit, the output is static."
    />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Stelstone — the git-based CMS your editors can't break" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Every record is a file in your repo, every publish is a commit, the output is static." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://stelstone.com" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <script is:inline>
      // Before first paint: restore the visitor's language choice.
      try {
        const l = localStorage.getItem("stelstone-lang");
        if (l === "tr" || l === "en") {
          document.documentElement.dataset.lang = l;
          document.documentElement.lang = l;
        }
      } catch {}
    </script>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="clip">
      <header class="top">
        <div class="shell bar">
          <a href="#top" class="wordmark">stelstone</a>
          <div class="badges">
            <a href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone"
              ><img
                src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/natilon/stelstone?style=flat-square&label=stars&color=2a2724&labelColor=2a2724"
                alt="GitHub stars"
                height="20"
              /></a
            >
            <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/stelstone"
              ><img
                src="https://img.shields.io/npm/v/stelstone?style=flat-square&label=npm&color=2a2724&labelColor=2a2724"
                alt="npm version"
                height="20"
              /></a
            >
          </div>
          <div class="grow"></div>
          <button class="lang-btn" id="lang-toggle" aria-label="Switch language">
            <span class="l-en">TR</span><span class="l-tr">EN</span>
          </button>
          <a class="nav-link" href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone">GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn amber" href="https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/?url=https://github.com/natilon/stelstone-starter">
            <span class="l-en">Deploy to Cloudflare</span><span class="l-tr">Cloudflare'e kur</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section id="top" class="shell hero">
        <div class="status mono">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="l-en">Astro integration · MIT · git-based CMS</span>
          <span class="l-tr">Astro entegrasyonu · MIT · git tabanlı CMS</span>
        </div>
        <h1>
          <span class="l-en">The CMS your editors can't break.</span>
          <span class="l-tr">Editörün siteyi bozamadığı CMS.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lede">
          <span class="l-en"
            >Every record is a file in your repo, every publish is a git commit, the output is static — and the
            support phone stays quiet.</span
          >
          <span class="l-tr"
            >Her kayıt repo'nuzda bir dosya, her yayın bir git commit'i, çıktı statik — ve destek telefonu
            susuyor.</span
          >
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn amber big" href="https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/?url=https://github.com/natilon/stelstone-starter">
            <span class="l-en">Deploy to Cloudflare</span><span class="l-tr">Cloudflare'e kur</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn ghost big" href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone">
            <span class="l-en">Read the source</span><span class="l-tr">Kaynağı oku</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="install mono">
          <span class="prompt">$</span>
          <code id="install-cmd">npm install stelstone</code>
          <button class="copy-btn mono" id="copy-install">
            <span data-state="idle"><span class="l-en">copy</span><span class="l-tr">kopyala</span></span>
            <span data-state="done" hidden><span class="l-en">copied</span><span class="l-tr">kopyalandı</span></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="band">
        <div class="shell pad">
          <h2>
            <span class="l-en">Three calls that never come</span>
            <span class="l-tr">Hiç gelmeyecek üç telefon</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="sub">
            <span class="l-en">The support calls that arrive after handoff, and the mechanism that makes each one impossible.</span>
            <span class="l-tr">Teslimden sonra gelen destek telefonları ve her birini imkânsız kılan mekanizma.</span>
          </p>
          <div class="cell-grid calls">
            <div class="cell">
              <p class="quote mono">“The site is broken.”</p>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en"
                  >It can't be. Editors write JSON records through /admin; the site itself is static HTML built from
                  them. There is no template to edit and no database to corrupt.</span
                >
                <span class="l-tr"
                  >Olamaz. Editör /admin üzerinden JSON kayıtları yazar; sitenin kendisi bunlardan derlenen statik
                  HTML'dir. Düzenlenecek şablon, bozulacak veritabanı yok.</span
                >
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="cell">
              <p class="quote mono">“This link is 404.”</p>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en"
                  >It can't be. Internal links are picked from a list of real pages and verified at build time. A broken
                  link fails the build instead of reaching production.</span
                >
                <span class="l-tr"
                  >Olamaz. İç linkler gerçek sayfa listesinden seçilir ve build'de doğrulanır. Kırık link yayına çıkmaz,
                  build'i durdurur.</span
                >
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="cell">
              <p class="quote mono">“Can we get yesterday's text back?”</p>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en"
                  >You can. Every publish is a commit, so yesterday's text is a revision in git — restoring it is a menu
                  item, not an archaeology project.</span
                >
                <span class="l-tr"
                  >Alabilirsin. Her yayın bir commit, yani dünkü metin git'te bir sürüm — geri almak bir menü
                  maddesi.</span
                >
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="shell pad">
          <h2>
            <span class="l-en">Deploy on a Friday.</span>
            <span class="l-tr">Cuma günü deploy et.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="sub">
            <span class="l-en">Six guardrails, each a mechanism rather than a policy.</span>
            <span class="l-tr">Altı koruma — her biri kural değil, mekanizma.</span>
          </p>
          <div class="rails">
            <div class="rail-item">
              <h3 class="mono"><span class="l-en">Draft branch</span><span class="l-tr">Taslak dalı</span></h3>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en">Save is not publish. Drafts commit to a separate branch and never touch the live build.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Kaydet ≠ yayınla. Taslaklar ayrı dala commit edilir, canlı build'e dokunmaz.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-item">
              <h3 class="mono"><span class="l-en">Page-by-page publish</span><span class="l-tr">Sayfa bazlı yayın</span></h3>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en">Publishing is per page. One editor finishing the about page can't push another's half-written pricing copy.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Yayın sayfa sayfadır. Hakkımızda'yı bitiren editör, başkasının yarım fiyat metnini yayına taşımaz.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-item">
              <h3 class="mono"><span class="l-en">Link verification at build</span><span class="l-tr">Build'de link doğrulama</span></h3>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en">Internal links are chosen from a list and checked when the site builds. A broken one stops the build.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">İç linkler listeden seçilir ve build sırasında kontrol edilir. Kırık olan build'i durdurur.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-item">
              <h3 class="mono"><span class="l-en">Automatic 301</span><span class="l-tr">Otomatik 301</span></h3>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en">A moved page keeps its old address: the redirect is written for you when the slug changes.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Taşınan sayfa eski adresini korur: slug değiştiğinde yönlendirme kendiliğinden yazılır.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-item">
              <h3 class="mono"><span class="l-en">Conflict protection</span><span class="l-tr">Çakışma koruması</span></h3>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en">Two editors can't overwrite each other — a stale edit is rejected instead of silently winning.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">İki editör birbirini ezemez — eskimiş bir düzenleme sessizce kazanmaz, reddedilir.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-item">
              <h3 class="mono"><span class="l-en">Scheduled publish</span><span class="l-tr">Zamanlanmış yayın</span></h3>
              <p class="body">
                <span class="l-en">Set a date and the commit lands then. Nobody stays up to press a button.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Tarihi ver, commit o an düşer. Butona basmak için kimse ayakta kalmaz.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="band">
        <div class="shell pad split">
          <div>
            <h2>
              <span class="l-en">Every publish is a commit.</span>
              <span class="l-tr">Her yayın bir commit.</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="lede-sm">
              <span class="l-en"
                >A record is a JSON file in your own repository. The admin writes it, git stores it, Astro builds it into
                static HTML. Undo is a menu item because history is git history.</span
              >
              <span class="l-tr"
                >Kayıt, kendi repo'nuzdaki bir JSON dosyasıdır. Admin yazar, git saklar, Astro statik HTML'e derler. Geri
                almak bir menü maddesidir, çünkü geçmiş git geçmişidir.</span
              >
            </p>
            <p class="lede-sm">
              <span class="l-en">Git-based like Decap and Keystatic — the difference: Stelstone knows your site's routes.</span>
              <span class="l-tr">Decap ve Keystatic gibi git tabanlı — fark: Stelstone sitenin route'larını bilir.</span>
            </p>
            <div class="proof-row">
              <div class="stat mono">
                <div class="num">340+</div>
                <div class="label">
                  <span class="l-en">automated tests</span><span class="l-tr">otomatik test</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <img
                src="https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/natilon/stelstone/ci.yml?style=flat-square&label=CI&color=2a2724&labelColor=2a2724"
                alt="CI status"
                height="20"
              />
              <a class="nav-link" href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone">GitHub →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="code-card">
            <div class="code-head mono">src/pages-data/pages/en-about.json</div>
            <pre class="mono" is:raw>{
  "slug": "about",
  "meta": { "title": "About us", "draft": false },
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "text", "properties": { "content": "&lt;p&gt;We're a small studio…&lt;/p&gt;" } }
  ]
}</pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="shell pad">
          <h2>
            <span class="l-en">From empty account to live in about ten minutes</span>
            <span class="l-tr">Boş hesaptan canlıya yaklaşık on dakika</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="sub">
            <span class="l-en">One Cloudflare Worker runs site, admin and API together. No KV, no extra config.</span>
            <span class="l-tr">Tek Cloudflare Worker'da site, admin ve API birlikte çalışır. KV yok, ek yapılandırma yok.</span>
          </p>
          <div class="setup-grid">
            <div class="code-card">
              <div class="code-head mono">astro.config.mjs</div>
              <pre class="mono diff" is:raw><span class="d-ctx">import { defineConfig } from "astro/config";</span>
<span class="d-add">+ import stelstone from "stelstone";</span>
<span class="d-add">+ import config from "./cms.config.mjs";</span>

<span class="d-ctx">export default defineConfig({</span>
<span class="d-add">+   integrations: [stelstone({ config })],</span>
<span class="d-ctx">});</span></pre>
            </div>
            <div class="setup-col">
              <div class="code-card">
                <div class="code-head mono">npm run dev</div>
                <pre class="mono">Stelstone mounted at /admin (admin UI: built bundle)</pre>
              </div>
              <div class="loop-card">
                <p class="body">
                  <span class="l-en">Install, open /admin, watch the commit land. That's the whole loop.</span>
                  <span class="l-tr">Kur, /admin'i aç, commit'in düştüğünü gör. Döngünün tamamı bu.</span>
                </p>
                <a class="btn amber" href="https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/?url=https://github.com/natilon/stelstone-starter">
                  <span class="l-en">Deploy to Cloudflare</span><span class="l-tr">Cloudflare'e kur</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="band">
        <div class="shell pad">
          <h2 class="mb-lg">
            <span class="l-en">Running in production</span>
            <span class="l-tr">Üretimde çalışıyor</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="cell-grid four">
            <div class="cell">
              <div class="kicker mono"><span class="l-en">Live site</span><span class="l-tr">Canlı site</span></div>
              <a class="big-link" href="https://dymdanismanlik.com">dymdanismanlik.com ↗</a>
              <p class="cell-note">
                <span class="l-en">Migrated from WordPress with word-by-word verification.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">WordPress'ten kelime kelime doğrulanmış migrasyonla taşındı.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="cell">
              <div class="kicker mono"><span class="l-en">Licence</span><span class="l-tr">Lisans</span></div>
              <div class="big-link plain">MIT</div>
              <p class="cell-note">
                <span class="l-en">Commercial use is free. No lock-in.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Ticari kullanım serbest. Kilitlenme yok.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="cell">
              <div class="kicker mono"><span class="l-en">Maintenance</span><span class="l-tr">Bakım</span></div>
              <a class="big-link" href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">CHANGELOG ↗</a>
              <p class="cell-note">
                <span class="l-en">Released versions, written down.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Yayınlanan sürümler, yazılı.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="cell">
              <div class="kicker mono"><span class="l-en">Framework</span><span class="l-tr">Çerçeve</span></div>
              <a class="big-link" href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone#quick-start">
                <span class="l-en">Astro integration ↗</span><span class="l-tr">Astro entegrasyonu ↗</span>
              </a>
              <p class="cell-note">
                <span class="l-en">Astro today — one framework, done properly.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Bugün yalnız Astro — tek çerçeve, düzgün yapılmış.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="shell pad migrate">
          <div>
            <h2 class="h2-sm">
              <span class="l-en">Client still on WordPress? We'll move them.</span>
              <span class="l-tr">Müşterin WordPress'te mi? Biz taşıyalım.</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="lede-sm last">
              <span class="l-en"
                >The deliverable is a word-by-word mechanical verification report: every page, every paragraph, checked
                against the original.</span
              >
              <span class="l-tr"
                >Teslimatın belgesi kelime kelime mekanik doğrulama raporudur: her sayfa, her paragraf, aslıyla
                karşılaştırılır.</span
              >
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="btn amber big" href="mailto:hello@stelstone.com?subject=Migrate%20from%20WordPress">
              <span class="l-en">Migrate from WordPress</span><span class="l-tr">WordPress'ten taşı</span>
            </a>
            <a class="btn ghost big" href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone">
              <span class="l-en">See a report</span><span class="l-tr">Örnek raporu gör</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="band">
        <div class="shell pad">
          <h2 class="mb-lg"><span class="l-en">Three ways in</span><span class="l-tr">Üç yol</span></h2>
          <div class="ways">
            <div class="way">
              <h3><span class="l-en">Open source</span><span class="l-tr">Açık kaynak</span></h3>
              <p class="body grow"><span class="l-en">MIT, install it today, host it yourself.</span><span class="l-tr">MIT, bugün kur, kendin barındır.</span></p>
              <a class="way-link" href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone">
                <span class="l-en">Get started →</span><span class="l-tr">Başla →</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="way">
              <h3><span class="l-en">Migration service</span><span class="l-tr">Taşıma servisi</span></h3>
              <p class="body grow">
                <span class="l-en">We move the client's WordPress site and hand you the verification report.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Müşterinin WordPress sitesini biz taşırız, doğrulama raporunu size veririz.</span>
              </p>
              <a class="way-link" href="mailto:hello@stelstone.com?subject=Migrate%20from%20WordPress">
                <span class="l-en">Request a migration →</span><span class="l-tr">Taşıma talebi →</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="way dashed">
              <div class="way-head">
                <h3 class="muted">Stelstone Cloud</h3>
                <span class="soon mono"><span class="l-en">coming soon</span><span class="l-tr">yakında</span></span>
              </div>
              <p class="body grow muted-body">
                <span class="l-en">Hosted, priced per site, unlimited editors.</span>
                <span class="l-tr">Barındırmalı, site başı fiyat, sınırsız editör.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <div class="shell foot">
          <div>
            <div class="wordmark foot-mark">stelstone</div>
            <p class="foot-story">
              <span class="l-en">From the Greek stēlē — the standing stone an inscription is carved into, and stone. Inscribed to last.</span>
              <span class="l-tr">Yunanca stēlē'den — üzerine yazıt kazınan dikili taş — ve stone. Yazıt kadar kalıcı içerik.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="foot-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/stelstone">npm</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/natilon/stelstone/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">CHANGELOG</a>
          </div>
          <div class="foot-meta">
            <div>Stelstone — by <a href="https://natilon.com">Natilon</a></div>
            <div class="mono faint">stele + stone · committed to last</div>
            <div class="mono faint">MIT · stelstone.com</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <script is:inline>
      const langBtn = document.getElementById("lang-toggle");
      langBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const next = document.documentElement.dataset.lang === "tr" ? "en" : "tr";
        document.documentElement.dataset.lang = next;
        document.documentElement.lang = next;
        try { localStorage.setItem("stelstone-lang", next); } catch {}
      });

      const copyBtn = document.getElementById("copy-install");
      let copyTimer;
      copyBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
        try { navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById("install-cmd").textContent); } catch {}
        copyBtn.querySelector('[data-state="idle"]').hidden = true;
        copyBtn.querySelector('[data-state="done"]').hidden = false;
        clearTimeout(copyTimer);
        copyTimer = setTimeout(() => {
          copyBtn.querySelector('[data-state="idle"]').hidden = false;
          copyBtn.querySelector('[data-state="done"]').hidden = true;
        }, 1600);
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #1c1a18;
    color: #e9e5dd;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Sans", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { color: #e5ab52; text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { color: #f3c883; }
  p { text-wrap: pretty; }
  .mono { font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; }

  /* Dil mekanizması: tasarımdaki hidden-binding'in CSS karşılığı */
  [data-lang="en"] .l-tr { display: none; }
  [data-lang="tr"] .l-en { display: none; }

  .clip { max-width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; }
  .shell { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 28px; padding-right: 28px; }
  .pad { padding-top: 88px; padding-bottom: 88px; }
  .band { border-top: 1px solid #2a2724; background: #191716; }
  section:not(.band) { border-top: 1px solid #2a2724; }
  section#top { border-top: 0; }

  /* ── Header ── */
  .top {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20;
    background: rgba(28, 26, 24, 0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #322e2a;
  }
  .bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; }
  .wordmark { font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #e9e5dd; }
  .badges { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-left: 8px; }
  .badges img { display: block; opacity: 0.9; }
  .grow { flex: 1; }
